<code>assert \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < index; (i < \old(this.size()) => this.get(i) == \old(this.get(i))) || (i >= \old(this.size()) => this.get(i) == null);</code>

This assertion ensures that for every valid index less than the specified index, the element at that index remains unchanged or is null both before and after the operation.
--------------------
